From: Book Buddy Handoff <handoff@bookbuddy.local>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 01:33:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] feat(marketplace): parent + teacher pages and nav links
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Thin route wrappers (role guard via getProfile() + redirect) around
the shared components/marketplace/* components:

  /{role}/marketplace              Browse + AI suggestions
  /{role}/marketplace/sell         Your listings + new listing
  /{role}/marketplace/sell/new     Create a listing
  /{role}/marketplace/sell/[id]    Edit a listing
  /{role}/marketplace/listing/[id] Listing detail + express interest

No /orders routes in this version — there's nothing to track once a
buyer and seller connect over messages, since Book Buddy isn't part of
the transaction.

Adds a plain 'Marketplace' link to ParentNav and TeacherNav — no badge,
since there's no order-driven action count anymore.
